                "description": "The Quaker Interior Plate with Netropol Knob is a traditional styled knobset great for adding elegance to any home. The Half Round Netropol Knob with Quaker Interior Plate is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Choose your favorite classic finish. This Knobset will fit most standard pre-drilled doors.",
